03125], "widgets_values": ["[主体] 人物资产参考：贞贞的外貌、发型与黑色吊带服装严格参考图1；T8的外貌特征参考图2，但需转化为与图1一致的写实真人质感，身穿现代休闲装。\n[动作]\nShot 1 — 中景固定镜头。T8坐在电脑桌前，屏幕蓝光映在脸上，他突然眉头紧锁，身体失去控制，重重地向前晕倒在键盘上。\nShot 2 — 快速跟随镜头。贞贞从画面右侧焦急地跑入镜头，神情惊恐，一边奔跑一边大声呼喊。台词：“快来人啊！T8晕倒了！”（语气急切、恐慌，带喘息声）。\nShot 3 — 近景特写。贞贞冲到桌前，迅速将T8扶正放平，双手交叠用力按压他的胸口进行心肺复苏，随后捏住他的鼻子，俯身为他做人工呼吸。动作专业且充满紧迫感。\n[场景] 现代简约的室内书房/卧室，夜晚，主要光源来自电脑屏幕的冷光与室内的暖色台灯，背景微微虚化，突出人物的紧张状态。\n[风格] 竖屏 9:16 短剧质感，真实真人表演，电影级光影，浅景深，情绪强烈，剪辑节奏紧凑。原生双声道输出，包含清晰的中文台词人声、急促的脚步声、衣物摩擦声与紧张的呼吸声。不要字幕，不要文字，不要水印，不要动画感，不要夸张舞台腔。", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 244, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 255, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 246, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 247, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 245, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 133, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "length": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 17}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.47.11", "VHS_latent